  "Message": "feat: Phase 2A — MCP cross-source root cause analysis tools (#29)\n\n* feat: add test-run-scoped API endpoints for cross-source data\n\nNew controller and service providing 8 GET endpoints under /test-runs/:id/\nthat resolve testRunId → SystemUnderTest → downstream instances internally:\n- data-sources: discover connected Grafana, Tempo, Pyroscope, Dynatrace\n- traces/slow, traces/errors, traces/:traceId: Tempo proxy with TraceQL\n- flamegraph, hotspots: Pyroscope proxy with collapsed-stack format\n- dashboard-snapshot: aggregate panel stats in one call\n- dynatrace/problems: Dynatrace problems API proxy\n\nIncludes input validation (traceId hex, service name escaping),\ndownstream timeouts, and proper NestJS exception handling.\n\n* feat: add 8 MCP tools for cross-source root cause analysis\n\nNew tools: list_connected_sources, get_grafana_dashboard_snapshot,\nget_slow_traces, get_trace_detail, get_error_traces, get_flamegraph,\nget_hotspots, get_dynatrace_problems.\n\nEach tool calls the new test-run-scoped API endpoints.\nIncludes 16 new tests for all PerfanaClient methods.\n\n* chore: update CHANGELOG and TODOS for Phase 2A MCP expansion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* chore: upgrade gstack skills to v0.11.8.0\n\n* fix: add id-token:write permission for Claude Code review action\n\nThe claude-code-action@v1 requires OIDC token access to authenticate.\nWithout id-token:write, the action fails with\n\"Unable to get ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_URL env variable\".\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Daniel Moll \u003cdmoll1974@gmail.com\u003e\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
  "Tags": [],
